 bands wrapped around the circumference of the catheter shaft create a cont=
inuous <span class=3D"math-inline" data-math=3D"360^\circ" data-index-in-no=
de=3D"126"><span class=3D"katex"><span class=3D"katex-html" aria-hidden=3D"=
