        &lt;span class=3D"math"&gt;V&lt;sub&gt;measured&lt;/sub&gt; =3D I&l=
t;sub&gt;sense&lt;/sub&gt; &amp;middot; Z&lt;sub&gt;CPE, sense&lt;/sub&gt; =
